      "message": "Since inside that function we are calling into the vendor service, which may delay the operation, it\u0027s better to serialize only the moment inside `parseAndSetVendorParameters` when we are actually calling into the stream. So let\u0027s pass the lock as a parameter so that `parseAndSet...` can do this job.\n\nIn fact, we should do the same for `DeviceHalAidl` for calls into `IModule`, too: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/av/media/libaudiohal/impl/DeviceHalAidl.cpp;l\u003d303;drc\u003d12ee7d7ddad324d2dd53e9362f8c9edbe931ff8c",
